            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "It bonds to concrete and will hold on small, contained repairs — a cracked planter, a leaking pond wall, the gap around a pipe penetration. It is not suitable for driveways, garage floors, patios or any large slab, because it is a mechanically-adhered film with no abrasion resistance and it will be lifted by moisture pushing up through the concrete.",
