            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Temporarily. It bridges the surface while water continues to travel through the full thickness of the crack, and pressure behind the patch eventually pushes it off. For a leaking crack in a poured wall, a polyurethane injection kit fills the crack front to back and is the lasting repair.",
